// Title: Renamed CreateDump Utility Execution
// ID: 1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-20
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
// Description: Detects uses of a renamed legitimate createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " -u ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " -f ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dmp"))) OR ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --full ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " --name ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".dmp")))) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR"))) AND NOT ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\createdump.exe"))))
